  <PropertyGroup>
    <Description>Zero-dependency object storage for .NET: named stores that each bind one bucket and key prefix, a vendor-neutral contract for reading, writing, listing, copying and presigning, an in-memory store for tests, and exceptions that classify failures instead of leaking a vendor SDK's.</Description>
